<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ report["title"] }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --text: #262626;
      --muted: #767676;
      --line: #d8d8d8;
      --soft-line: #ebebeb;
      --panel: #f8f8f8;
      --up: #c9655c;
      --down: #4b8faf;
      --flat: #727272;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .report {
      width: min(720px, calc(100vw - 36px));
      margin: 28px auto 40px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .meta {
      margin: -10px 0 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    section {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .market-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--columns), minmax(0, 1fr));
      border-top: 2px solid #bfbfbf;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .market-item {
      min-width: 0;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--soft-line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--soft-line);
    }

    .market-name {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 58px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 14px;
      background: var(--panel);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .market-value {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 60px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      color: var(--flat);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .market-value.up {
      color: var(--up);
    }

    .market-value.down {
      color: var(--down);
    }

    .value {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .missing {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .footnote {
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .report {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 720px);
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .market-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .market-item {
        border-right: 0;
      }

      .market-name {
        min-height: 48px;
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .market-value {
        min-height: 52px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="report">
    <h1>{{ report["title"] }}</h1>
    <p class="meta">생성일 {{ report["as_of_date"] }} · 조회 기준 {{ report["target_date"] }} · {{ report["timezone"] }}</p>

    {% for section in report["sections"] %}
    <section aria-labelledby="section-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 id="section-{{ loop.index }}">{{ section["name"] }}</h2>
      <div class="market-grid" style="--columns: {{ section["columns"] }}">
        {% for item in section["items"] %}
        <article class="market-item" title="{{ item["symbol"] }}{% if item["trade_date"] %} · {{ item["trade_date"] }}{% endif %}">
          <div class="market-name">{{ item["label"] }}</div>
          <div class="market-value {{ item["direction"] }}">
            {% if item["status"] == "ok" %}
            <span class="value">{{ item["value_text"] }}</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">{{ item["arrow"] }}</span>
            <span>{{ item["percent_text"] }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="missing">데이터 없음</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}

    <p class="footnote">
      수치는 FinanceDataReader로 조회한 기준일 이전의 마지막 두 거래일 종가를 비교해 계산했습니다.
      휴장일이나 데이터 지연이 있으면 실제 거래일은 항목별로 달라질 수 있습니다.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
